{
  "id": "A47",
  "goal": "INC01-S1",
  "title": "Owner-runner operations: an owner's bounded operation on their own qualified native resource, admitted durably and reconciled by its original native identities",
  "why": [
    "SOPHIA-INC-2026-11 INC-01 slice S1 and shared contract C02 (docs/execution/2026-11-08-incremental, PR #503, unmerged): one SophiaRunnerPort behind which a qualified owner-native T3 route runs. Assigned to INC01-CC-002 with migration 0092; its generated output is regenerated with `pnpm --filter @sophia/contracts generate`, never by hand.",
    "No existing operation covers it. The native-task POST (A05) is retired as draft_brief (A08) and stays retired; goal commands (admitGoalCommand) and the conversation Ask/reply contracts are not overloaded.",
    "Admission is owner-bound (only the resource's owner, an editor or admin of the project) and requires an operator-recorded qualification of that owner's route (sophia.qualify_owner_runner, migration owner only). No production qualification exists; with none, every admission is refused before a write. The routes are always served. SOPHIA_OWNER_RUNNERS gates new work only: unset or off refuses a create or an input (runner_admission_disabled), but still admits a qualified owner's Stop of a running binding with all its checks while the owner keeps reading work already admitted, its uncertainty and its native identities; admit admits. A database without 0092 answers the reads projection_unavailable (503), never an empty list; /ready requires 0092 only with admissions on.",
    "A received operation carries a native receipt only: it is never accepted, applied, merged or verified. Unknown means a send may have happened; it is reconciled by the original native identities, never resent under a new session, and never returns to admitted: no gateway journal proves that a possible send did not happen. Hold, Resume, permission approval and question answers are refused as unsupported."
  ],
  "patch": [
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperationRequest",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "An owner's operation on their own native executor resource (A47). Admitted only on a route an operator qualified after a real owner-host qualification; none is qualified by a request. hold, resume, resolve_permission and answer_question are named so they are refused as unsupported (runner_operation_unsupported), never emulated.",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["create", "input", "stop", "hold", "resume", "resolve_permission", "answer_question"]
          },
          "resourceId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "goalId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "create only: the goal the new attempt and binding serve."
          },
          "targetOperationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid",
            "description": "input and stop only: the owner's create operation whose native thread they target."
          },
          "title": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 120,
            "description": "create only."
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 8000,
            "description": "create and input only. An input is always queued for the thread's manager, never steered."
          },
          "expectedGoalRevision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "expectedAuthorityEpoch": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          }
        },
        "required": ["kind", "resourceId"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperationReceipt",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["create", "input", "stop"]
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["admitted", "possible_send", "received", "rejected", "denied", "unknown", "settled"]
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "admittedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          }
        },
        "required": ["operationId", "kind", "state", "revision", "admittedAt"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperation",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The owner's retained view of one operation. received means a native receipt only: never accepted, applied or verified. unknown means a send may have happened and nothing proves either way.",
        "properties": {
          "operationId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "kind": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["create", "input", "stop"]
          },
          "state": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": ["admitted", "possible_send", "received", "rejected", "denied", "unknown", "settled"]
          },
          "reason": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 500
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "goalId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "resourceId": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uuid"
          },
          "targetOperationId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "title": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 120
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "message": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 8000
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "revision": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 1,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "admittedAt": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "date-time"
          },
          "possibleSendAt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "receivedAt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "settledAt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "nativeThreadId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 400
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "nativeRunId": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 400
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "nativeDelivery": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["started", "queued", "stop_requested", "no_active_run", "already_ended"]
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "runStatus": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 40
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "deferrals": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          },
          "reconcileAttempts": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "maximum": 9007199254740991
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "operationId",
          "kind",
          "state",
          "reason",
          "goalId",
          "resourceId",
          "targetOperationId",
          "title",
          "message",
          "revision",
          "admittedAt",
          "possibleSendAt",
          "receivedAt",
          "settledAt",
          "nativeThreadId",
          "nativeRunId",
          "nativeDelivery",
          "runStatus",
          "deferrals",
          "reconcileAttempts"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperationList",
      "value": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "operations": {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 100,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperation"
            }
          }
        },
        "required": ["operations"]
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1runner-operations",
      "value": {
        "post": {
          "tags": ["runner-operations"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "x-sophia-implementation": "implemented",
          "x-sophia-release-goal": "INC01-S1",
          "operationId": "admitOwnerRunnerOperation",
          "summary": "Admit an operation on the caller's own qualified native resource: kept with its command and outbox row; nothing is sent in this request.",
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "Idempotency-Key",
              "in": "header",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "minLength": 1,
                "maxLength": 160
              }
            }
          ],
          "requestBody": {
            "required": true,
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperationRequest"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "responses": {
            "202": {
              "description": "Admitted, or the first receipt for the same key and request.",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperationReceipt"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "403": {
              "description": "Not permitted; new work (create, input) is off (runner_admission_disabled); or the route is not qualified (runner_unqualified)",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "409": {
              "description": "Stale goal, target not ready, or the key reused with another request",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Invalid request, a foreign or missing id, or an unsupported kind (runner_operation_unsupported)",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "503": {
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "Owner-runner operations are not installed on this database (projection_unavailable), or the database is unavailable"
            }
          }
        },
        "get": {
          "tags": ["runner-operations"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "x-sophia-implementation": "implemented",
          "x-sophia-release-goal": "INC01-S1",
          "operationId": "listOwnerRunnerOperations",
          "summary": "The caller's own operations in the project, newest first (at most 100). Served while admissions are off.",
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            }
          ],
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "The caller's operations.",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperationList"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "403": {
              "description": "Not a member",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "503": {
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "Owner-runner operations are not installed on this database (projection_unavailable), or the database is unavailable"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "op": "add",
      "path": "/paths/~1api~1v1~1projects~1{projectId}~1runner-operations~1{operationId}",
      "value": {
        "get": {
          "tags": ["runner-operations"],
          "security": [
            {
              "supabaseBearer": []
            }
          ],
          "x-sophia-implementation": "implemented",
          "x-sophia-release-goal": "INC01-S1",
          "operationId": "getOwnerRunnerOperation",
          "summary": "One of the caller's operations; another's answers like a missing one.",
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "projectId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            },
            {
              "name": "operationId",
              "in": "path",
              "required": true,
              "schema": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "uuid"
              }
            }
          ],
          "responses": {
            "200": {
              "description": "The operation.",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OwnerRunnerOperation"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "401": {
              "description": "Unauthenticated"
            },
            "422": {
              "description": "Not found",
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            "503": {
              "content": {
                "application/json": {
                  "schema": {
                    "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Error"
                  }
                }
              },
              "description": "Owner-runner operations are not installed on this database (projection_unavailable), or the database is unavailable"
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}
